    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Party Extreme plays like the Snake you remember, so you already know how it works: collect the targets, avoid the walls, and avoid yourself.\u00a0 But you've never played it like this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 4-player Battle Mode features several optional modifiers that transform Snake from a game into a party!\u00a0 The main attraction is Suffocation: crashes no longer penalize you.\u00a0 In order to be eliminated, you need to be TRAPPED for 3 seconds.\u00a0 This one small change makes the game more accessible, more intense, more chaotic, and more fun!\u00a0 But there's more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corpse leaves eliminated players on the stage as obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variable Speed semi-randomly changes the snake speed every few seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reversal changes your direction each time you take a target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adding Teleporters to the stage just makes everything bonkers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood to battle?\u00a0 Want to test your skills?\u00a0 Snake Party Extreme features tons of challenging arcade-style content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 5+ hour Campaign for 1 or 2 players, spanning 300+ stages of increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 Missions, short challenges that truly test your arcade ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique Survival Modes, featuring classic Snake &quot;how long can you last?&quot; gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-player Gauntlet Mode, 2-player Score Competition, Classic Mode and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, there's a full set of Achievements, over 60 Leaderboards, multiple control methods, assist features for kids of all ages, a high-energy soundtrack featuring Oscillator X (Kyle Ward &amp; John Mendenhall), and more!\u00a0 Experience the complete evolution of 2008's Snake360 and 2016's Snake Party...this is Snake Party Extreme!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Party Extreme plays like the Snake you remember, so you already know how it works: collect the targets, avoid the walls, and avoid yourself.\u00a0 But you've never played it like this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 4-player Battle Mode features several optional modifiers that transform Snake from a game into a party!\u00a0 The main attraction is Suffocation: crashes no longer penalize you.\u00a0 In order to be eliminated, you need to be TRAPPED for 3 seconds.\u00a0 This one small change makes the game more accessible, more intense, more chaotic, and more fun!\u00a0 But there's more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corpse leaves eliminated players on the stage as obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variable Speed semi-randomly changes the snake speed every few seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reversal changes your direction each time you take a target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adding Teleporters to the stage just makes everything bonkers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood to battle?\u00a0 Want to test your skills?\u00a0 Snake Party Extreme features tons of challenging arcade-style content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 5+ hour Campaign for 1 or 2 players, spanning 300+ stages of increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 Missions, short challenges that truly test your arcade ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique Survival Modes, featuring classic Snake &quot;how long can you last?&quot; gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-player Gauntlet Mode, 2-player Score Competition, Classic Mode and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, there's a full set of Achievements, over 60 Leaderboards, multiple control methods, assist features for kids of all ages, a high-energy soundtrack featuring Oscillator X (Kyle Ward &amp; John Mendenhall), and more!\u00a0 Experience the complete evolution of 2008's Snake360 and 2016's Snake Party...this is Snake Party Extreme!</p>",
    "short_description": "The best Snake game ever made. A chaotic, unforgettable, laugh-out-loud 4-player couch battle. An intense test of your arcade gaming skills. Snake Party Extreme is all of these...and so, so much more!",
